> - Narrow path through rocky hills, wind constantly shifting around Ekemon.
> - Distant low rumbles of thunder, even though the sky is mostly clear.
> - The Titan Seed beats like a heart when lightning flashes on the horizon.
> 
> **Quick RP Prompt:**
> - Ask each: “What does your character talk about on the road?”
>   - Dru: explain the Fourfold Mother and the Storm-Titan myth.
>   - Varkash: maybe talks about glory, contracts, or distrust of priests.
>   - Ekemon: you ask your son what Ekemon wants from the Titan power.
> 
> > Optional check:  
> > - **DC 10 Insight (Dru or Varkash)** – Notice Ekemon seems more “stormy” when angry or excited.  
> > - On success, you can say: “You notice the wind and distant thunder seem to react to him.”
> 
> ---
> 
