> 
> (If they go here first. If not, run the Human camp scene first and swap the order.)
> 
> ### 3.1 Arrival & Welcome
> 
> - Dru is warmly welcomed.
> - Ekemon and Varkash get cautious looks, but no open hostility.
> 
> **Archdruid Lysara**:
> - Older elf, calm, hair with leaves braided in.
> - Speaks slowly and respectfully.
> 
> Key info to deliver (you can parcel it out in conversation):
> 
> - “The storm is the **Titan’s Heartshard** calling out from inside the old sky-temple.”
> - “We fear if it is **ripped out** or destroyed crudely, the canyon walls might collapse, or the weather across the region could go wild.”
> - “We want to **stabilize** it, soothe it, and maybe guide its power rather than smother it.”
> 
> **About Ekemon & the Titan Seed:**
> - Lysara steps closer, eyes narrowing kindly.
