> 
> They enter a corridor where lightning jumps between metal rods in the walls.
> 
> At the end, they see a **Human Church scout**, perhaps a young Dawn-Knight named **Tomas**, trying to get past the lightning. He is not a Purifier; he looks frightened and is in over his head.
> 
> He sees Ekemon.
> 
> > “Stay back! This place must be cleansed!”
