> 
> 2. **Ignore him and rush onward**
>    - They get ahead, but Tomas may later return with the Human forces.
>    - This signals Ekemon prioritizing the Heartshard over an enemy’s life.
> 
> 3. **Threaten him into helping**
>    - DC 11 Intimidation.
>    - He gives the information but will be afraid of Ekemon—and likely report that the “Titan-monster” threatened him.
> 
> ---
> 
